<div class="lr">
  <div class="lr__zones">
    <div class="lr__zone">
      <span class="lr__zone-num">01</span>
      <h3>Lordotic Cervical Extension Roll</h3>
      <p>A firmer roll under the neck that holds your natural 30&deg;&ndash;35&deg; arc, so the cable stays curved instead of folding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lr__zone">
      <span class="lr__zone-num">02</span>
      <h3>Recessed Central Occipital Cavity</h3>
      <p>A cradle set 1.5&ndash;2in <em>below</em> the neck roll. On your back, the skull settles into it and the base of the skull opens rather than compressing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lr__zone">
      <span class="lr__zone-num">03</span>
      <h3>Dual-Loft Lateral Sleeping Wings</h3>
      <p>The outer thirds are built taller &mdash; 4.5&ndash;5.5in &mdash; to match shoulder width. Roll onto your side and you land on a surface that&rsquo;s already the right height. That&rsquo;s the handoff single-height pillows can&rsquo;t make.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lr__zone">
      <span class="lr__zone-num">04</span>
      <h3>Integrated Ear Depressions</h3>
      <p>Recesses in each wing so the outer ear isn&rsquo;t compressed against a firm surface all night &mdash; the failure mode behind the ear pain and jaw soreness that kills most firm contour pillows.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
